<title>BELGIUM: EU CLEARS UPM-KYMMENE CONTROL OF FINNPAP.</title>
<headline>EU CLEARS UPM-KYMMENE CONTROL OF FINNPAP.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Tuesday it had cleared the acquisition of full control by Finnish paper giant UPM-Kymmene Oy of Finnpap Ltd from Metsa-Serla Oy and Myllyloski Oy.</p>
<p>The Commission said in a statement the operation would not add to UPM-Kymmene's market share. Finnpap will be handling the marketing and sale of UPM-Kymmene's products.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
